The word lists (/usr/share/plinius-words/*.words) are derived from FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave,
https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords (content/2018, built from OpenSubtitles 2018),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changes: words shorter than four characters,
non-words and stutters left out; case and selection by the hunspell dictionaries of Arch Linux.
The derived lists are under the same license.

